rc/main/jib` folder, if the `app` folder is used here (e.g. with a file `src/main/jib/app/foo`), then the `/app` folder created in the container image *does not have \"o+x\" permission*.\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\n`/app` folder in the container image has \"o+x\" permission, like it does when Jib extra directories feature is not used.\r\n\r\n**Actual behavior**\r\n`/app` folder in the container image doesn't have \"o+x\" permission, thus not allowing non-root users to load the app.\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\n\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n1. Use Jib for creating container image.\r\n2. Add some files in `src/main/jib/app/` folder.\r\n\r\n**Environment (please complete the following information):**\r\n - Output of `uname -a` or `ver`: Darwin *** 19.6.0 Darwin Kernel Version 19.6.0: Mon Aug 31 22:12:52 PDT 2020; root:xnu-6153.141.2~1/RELEASE_X86_64 x86_64\r\n - Output of `java -version`: AdoptOpenJDK OpenJ9 11.0.9\r\n - GraalVM version (if different from Java): \r\n - Quarkus version or git rev: 1.6.0.Final  (the feature was introduced in 1.6)\r\n - Build tool (ie. output of `mvnw --version` or `gradlew --version`): Gradle 6.6.1\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\n(Add any other context about the problem here.)\r\n\n\n---\n\nhttps://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/13322\n\n---\n\n$upstream:13322$","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snowdrop-zen/quarkus/issues/213/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snowdrop-zen/quarkus/issues/213/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":4006194298,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDQwMDYxOTQyOTg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/events/4006194298","actor":{"login":"geoand","id":4374975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNzQ5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4374975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","